          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "narrator",
            portrait: "wesnoth-icon.png",
            text: _("A large tree stands alone in a clearing. Driven into the trunk is a huge sword with flames dancing along its blade. Strangely, while the trunk near the sword is blackened and scorched, the tree seems otherwise unaffected by the flames."),
          },
